   Output: (time_bucket('@ 1 hour'::interval, ts, '2000-12-31 19:02:30-05'::timestamp with time zone)), (sum(n))
   Relations: Aggregate on (ts_metrics)
   Remote SQL: SELECT (toStartOfInterval(toDateTime64(ts, 6) - INTERVAL 150000000 MICROSECOND, INTERVAL 3600000000 MICROSECOND) + INTERVAL 150000000 MICROSECOND), sum(n) FROM timescaledb_test.metrics GROUP BY ((toStartOfInterval(toDateTime64(ts, 6) - INTERVAL 150000000 MICROSECOND, INTERVAL 3600000000 MICROSECOND) + INTERVAL 150000000 MICROSECOND)) ORDER BY (toStartOfInterval(toDateTime64(ts, 6) - INTERVAL 150000000 MICROSECOND, INTERVAL 3600000000 MICROSECOND) + INTERVAL 150000000 MICROSECOND) ASC NULLS LAST
(4 rows)

